  "title": "意外之旅",
  "storyCode": "GT-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "f7d031980cd5cb3ec8002816b2395554503be7fc8c5bfd79a03f9f5c646cc07c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_forest"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "干掉了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大鲍勃，你没事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦？你腿上的伤口......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_008",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里有漏网的！可能是瓦各斯克团的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个我自己能处理！先击退敌人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这小个子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，喂，你那是什么眼神？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别，别过来，不怕我在你身上开个窟窿吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赏金猎人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_007",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你都解决了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真厉害。这么小的个子，本事倒是不小。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坐在那里别动。我来给你包扎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不碍事，让我起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看到了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看到我身上的结晶了吧？你难道想被感染吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感染者，本来就是我们罗德岛的救助对象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛是......？不是维多利亚......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前是维多利亚的骑警，不过现在，是罗德岛的干员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "离我远一点，小姑娘。我是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可萝尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_003",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可萝尔小姐，这可能有点血腥，你稍稍回避下吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好啦，已经止血了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你经常这么做吗，给感染者？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就不怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的同事有很多都感染了矿石病，但我分不出究竟有谁感染了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格拉尼",
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就洗澡的时候能看得出来吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多谢你了，没戒心的小个子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大鲍勃",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_010",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_220_grani",
      "aliases": [
        "格拉尼"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
